{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-general-comment-on-the-draft-resolution-on-freedom-of-expression","content_id":"8e75d261-0f0d-4c40-847d-1a4b93f973d0","description":"UK General Comment on the draft resolution on freedom of expression. Delivered by UK Human Rights Ambassador, Eleanor Sanders.","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Thank you, Mr President</p>\n\n<p>The UK is pleased to join consensus on this important resolution and thanks the Core Group for its leadership throughout the negotiations. Freedom of opinion and expression is a cornerstone of democratic societies, accountability, and the protection of all human rights.</p>\n\n<p>At a time when journalists, media workers, human rights defenders, and civil society actors face growing threats, this resolution sends a clear signal that they must be able to carry out their work freely and safely. The strengthened  language on safety of journalists, combating impunity, transnational repression, and strategic lawsuits against public participation is welcome.</p>\n\n<p>We particularly welcome the resolution’s strong recognition of the barriers that women and girls continue to face in exercising their right to freedom of opinion and expression. The strengthened language on technology-facilitated gender-based violence, digital inequalities, and the importance of women’s and girls’ full, equal, meaningful and safe participation online and offline is especially important.</p>\n\n<p>We welcome the resolution’s focus on digital technologies, artificial intelligence, and information integrity. Responses to disinformation must remain rooted in international human rights law while promoting transparency, accountability, and access to reliable information.</p>\n\n<p>As co-chair of the Media Freedom Coalition alongside Finland, the UK remains steadfast in its commitment to media freedom worldwide and is proud once again to support this resolution.</p>\n\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-07T15:53:44Z"}],"delivered_on":"2026-07-06T00:00:00+01:00","first_public_at":"2026-07-07T16:53:44.000+01:00","image":{"alt_text":"Eleanor Sanders","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/66f261ca53d61b1b433ee2eb/Eleanor_2.jpg"},"location":"Geneva","political":true,"speech_type_explanation":"Transcript of the speech, exactly as it was delivered"},"document_type":"speech","first_published_at":"2026-07-07T16:53:44+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-general-comment-on-the-draft-resolution-on-freedom-of-expression","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-general-comment-on-the-draft-resolution-on-freedom-of-expression","base_path":"/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-general-comment-on-the-draft-resolution-on-freedom-of-expression","content_id":"8e75d261-0f0d-4c40-847d-1a4b93f973d0","document_type":"speech","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:53:44Z","schema_name":"speech","title":"UN Human Rights Council 62: UK General Comment on the draft resolution on freedom of expression","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/un-human-rights-council-62-uk-general-comment-on-the-draft-resolution-on-freedom-of-expression","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Foreign, Commonwealth<br/>&amp; Development Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","base_path":"/government/people/eleanor-sanders","content_id":"4301c606-5fdc-4e77-bbf1-1dbce629f3c8","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2024-09-24T08:38:41Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Eleanor Sanders","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/eleanor-sanders","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Foreign, Commonwealth<br/>&amp; Development Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"content_id":"9066fb8d-4a60-442b-8b3f-6f6c10936714","details":{"body":"<p>The UK’s Ambassador for Human Rights exists to defend and advance human rights and democracy globally. Promoting human rights and the rule of law is fundamental to maintaining stability and preventing conflict and is therefore at the heart of the UK’s interests.  </p>\n\n<p>The Ambassador for Human Rights has 3 main objectives:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>protecting and promoting human rights within the multilateral system, including at the United Nations Human Rights Council</li>\n  <li>working in partnership with countries to support and advance human rights</li>\n  <li>promoting other human rights campaigns in support of the UK’s international priorities</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The Ambassador engages with civil society and human rights defenders. Through country missions, she engages with states, human rights institutions and other international partners to champion positive progress made by states, encourage advances and identify areas for collaboration and partnership to support protections and promotion of human rights within those countries.</p>\n","role_payment_type":null},"document_type":"ambassador_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-02T16:11:40Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Ambassador for Human Rights and Deputy Permanent Representative to the United Nations and other International Organisations in Geneva ","withdrawn":false}],"speaker":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/eleanor-sanders","base_path":"/government/people/eleanor-sanders","content_id":"4301c606-5fdc-4e77-bbf1-1dbce629f3c8","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2024-09-24T08:38:41Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Eleanor Sanders","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/eleanor-sanders","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international/human-rights-internationally","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international/human-rights-internationally","base_path":"/international/human-rights-internationally","content_id":"cb7db7bb-d0b4-4e22-9f0b-58a28c2db38c","details":{"internal_name":"Human rights internationally [P]","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international","base_path":"/international","content_id":"37d0fa26-abed-4c74-8835-b3b51ae1c8b2","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"International","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document_type":"homepage","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-18T13:00:23Z","schema_name":"homepage","title":"GOV.UK homepage","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-09-16T20:30:28Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"International","web_url":"https: